  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "Sanbi追踪召唤后发现源头是身在中国的九尾狐本体，三人因此前往Land of Dragons查明真相",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "After thorough research and careful energy tracing, they discovered its source—her main body, the legendary nine-tailed fox, residing somewhere in China. Determined to uncover the truth, Hiro, Sanbi and Yoshiko set off on a journey to The Land of Dragons, ready to face whatever awaited them and unravel the mystery behind Sanbi’s summons.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405160/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "六角地图包含战斗、宝箱和剧情事件节点，每轮选路都会为棋盘部队积累强化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Players will now navigate their adventure on a hex-based map featuring diverse floor designs. Explore various hex-node types, including battles, treasure chests, and scenario events, to strengthen your units.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405160/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "在棋盘式战场布置单位，再用Powerstone把角色进化到最终形态并释放强力技能",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Strategically place your units on a chessboard-inspired battlefield to defend your realm. Harness Powerstones to evolve your units into their ultimate forms and unleash powerful skill attacks.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405160/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
